pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 10, 80, 20]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 10, 80, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        Ch04
  - elementId: ev-badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [1060, 10, 160, 20]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: ev-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1060, 10, 160, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        E3 / Draft
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 36, 990, 42]
    content:
      fontSize: 32
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>NanoZone: CCA 细粒度内存保护 — 内容摘要</strong></p>
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 80, 120, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 92, 1160, 590]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>探索 Arm CCA 上更可扩展、更细粒度的内存保护域，缓解 VM/Realm 粒度过粗的问题。</p>
        <p>NanoZone 作为草案级 SOTA 工作，研究 CCA granule/lifecycle 能否支撑更小保护域。预印本状态提供了前沿设计方向，但尚不能代表同行评议共识或硬件/OS 生态成熟度。</p>
        <p>论文定位：当前 SOTA/补充边界；材料类型：系统论文；证据等级：E3 / 草案/未批准规范。</p>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        来源：NanoZone: CCA 细粒度内存保护｜证据等级：E3 / Draft-not-ratified
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
